YAWOD: Yet another way of dying: lycanthropy over water
Somebody posted recently, asking what dangers he should beware of when
high on HP & AC & feeling cocky.  Well, one more to add to the list -- I
was in Gehennom, feeling cocky & confident -- I was on Jubilex's level,
levitating over the water with Perseus' boots.  Retractable Mojo,
Magicbane, GDSM, AC-17, & HP~200.  Somewhere on the maze level upstairs
I had dealt with a werewolf, and the thought flickered briefly in the
back of my mind, "Did it nick me with its teeth?", but I dismissed the
thought and forged ahead.  Downstairs, over the middle of the water, I
turned into a werewolf, my boots fell off, and I drowned.  The GDSM made
me feel oblivious to polymorph traps, but I forgot about the fact that
polymorph protection doesn't cover lycanthropy.  Dang.

